<span id="S3.F2.pic1.1.3" class="ltx_p">Imagine that you want to assign a task to a physical <span id="S3.F2.pic1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">robot</span>. The original task is written in text in the "<span id="S3.F2.pic1.1.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Original Text</span>" field.</span>
<span id="S3.F2.pic1.1.4" class="ltx_p">You are required to <span id="S3.F2.pic1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">rephrase</span> this text and write it in your own words in the “<span id="S3.F2.pic1.1.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Your rephrasing</span>” (in your own words) field, keeping the original meaning.</span>
