<span id="A1.F7.pic1.1.8" class="ltx_p">Now, convert the following text:</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.1.9" class="ltx_p">Text: instruction</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 146.04 219.19 L -146.04 219.19 C -149.09 219.19 -151.57 216.71 -151.57 213.65 L -151.57 201.66 C -151.57 198.6 -149.09 196.12 -146.04 196.12 L 146.04 196.12 C 149.09 196.12 151.57 198.6 151.57 201.66 L 151.57 213.65 C 151.57 216.71 149.09 219.19 146.04 219.19 Z M -151.57 196.12"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#FFFFFF;--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#FFFFFF" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -146.96 204.2)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:21.24em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="293.9"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
