</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.F7.pic2" class="ltx_picture ltx_figure_panel" height="374.84" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-104.01px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 961.42 374.84" width="961.42"><g transform="translate(0,374.84) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(480.71,0) translate(0,182.75)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#808080;--ltx-fill-color:#E6E6E6;" fill="#E6E6E6" stroke="#808080" stroke-width="1.2pt"><path d="M 474.34 181.92 L -474.34 181.92 C -477.4 181.92 -479.88 179.44 -479.88 176.38 L -479.88 -176.38 C -479.88 -179.44 -477.4 -181.92 -474.34 -181.92 L 474.34 -181.92 C 477.4 -181.92 479.88 -179.44 479.88 -176.38 L 479.88 176.38 C 479.88 179.44 477.4 181.92 474.34 181.92 Z M -479.88 -181.92"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="1.2pt" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -466.04 -3.46)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:19.83em;--ltx-fo-height:11.4em;--ltx-fo-depth:10.9em;font-size:10pt;" height="308.49" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 157.71)" width="274.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.F7.pic2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:19.83em;">
<span id="A1.F7.pic2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Convert the text into a command for the robot by removing all irrelevant context. Save details that may be important for the robot to find and move objects according to the target command. Here are some examples:</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic2.1.2" class="ltx_p">Text: today is a nice weather open the middle drawer of the cabinet</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic2.1.3" class="ltx_p">Filtered: open the middle drawer of the cabinet</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic2.1.4" class="ltx_p">Text: i think it’s a good idea to push the plate to the front of the stove</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic2.1.5" class="ltx_p">Filtered: push the plate to the front of the stove</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic2.1.6" class="ltx_p">Text: it is quiet at home put the cream cheese in the bowl</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic2.1.7" class="ltx_p">Filtered: put the cream cheese in the bowl</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic2.1.8" class="ltx_p">Now, convert the following text:</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic2.1.9" class="ltx_p">Text: instruction</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 146.04 192.09 L -146.04 192.09 C -149.09 192.09 -151.57 189.61 -151.57 186.55 L -151.57 178.94 C -151.57 175.89 -149.09 173.41 -146.04 173.41 L 146.04 173.41 C 149.09 173.41 151.57 175.89 151.57 178.94 L 151.57 186.55 C 151.57 189.61 149.09 192.09 146.04 192.09 Z M -151.57 173.41"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#FFFFFF;--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#FFFFFF" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -146.96 178.02)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:21.24em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="293.9"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.F7.pic2.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:21.24em;">
<span id="A1.F7.pic2.2.1" class="ltx_p"></span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic2.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F7.pic2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">LIBERO Instruction</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></svg></span></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Examples of instructions with 1 type of irrelevant context used in the filtering framework.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A1.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p">This approach relies on few-shot prompting with LLMs, demonstrating its ability to discard irrelevant context effectively without knowledge of the robot’s training process or task feasibility.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ A.2 Instructions examples and results of the filtering framework ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Bring the Apple , Not the Sofa : Impact of Irrelevant Context in Embodied AI Commands on VLA Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> demonstrates how this type of prompt instructions can generalize filtering across different types of context.
As can be seen from the table, the generalization is generally present, but “Infeasible” type of noise requires additional information or examples about the robot’s abilities.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ A.2 Instructions examples and results of the filtering framework ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Bring the Apple , Not the Sofa : Impact of Irrelevant Context in Embodied AI Commands on VLA Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> highlights the potential pitfalls for filtering framework, when important details can be accidentally removed.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T8" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A1.T8.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.T8.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T8.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;" colspan="2"><span id="A1.T8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Setup</span></th>
<th id="A1.T8.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;"><span id="A1.T8.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Original</span></th>
<th id="A1.T8.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;"><span id="A1.T8.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Linking</span></th>
